# File Size And Formatting

For every coding task in this project:

- Keep each touched source, test, config, and markdown file at **200 lines or fewer**.
- If a touched file would exceed 200 lines, split it into focused modules before finishing.
- Run Prettier or a Prettier check on all touched files before the final response.
- When adding tests, split test suites into focused files instead of allowing a single test file to grow past 200 lines.
- Mention any exception explicitly if a file cannot reasonably be split.
